  <scopecontent id="39b776b6e4744d1dd3274e8ea55e54b6">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>The collection contains accounting office records related to fellowships and grants, including acceptance letters, budgets, and payment schedules, for fellowships awarded by SSRC committees. Each folder typically contains a summary table listing award recipients for a particular year. Both predoctoral grants and postdoctoral research grants are represented throughout the collection.</p>  </scopecontent>
